# HELIOS Platform code ownership.
#
# Single-owner repo today (@Yolkster64), so every rule resolves to the same
# reviewer — the value here is the reviewed-paths STRUCTURE plus the lane
# comments naming which agent lane authors each area (owner lanes are defined
# in docs/architecture/FORWARD_PLAN.md). When collaborators or teams arrive,
# swap the owner on the relevant line without redesigning the map.
#
# CODEOWNERS semantics: gitignore-style patterns, LAST matching rule wins —
# keep general rules first, specific rules last. Owners without write access
# are silently ignored by GitHub.

# --- Default: everything not matched below routes to the owner. -------------
# Authored by: any lane; reviewed through the Copilot+Codex loop, owner merges.
*                       @Yolkster64

# --- CI / workflows: owner-only lane. ----------------------------------------
# Workflow changes alter what CI enforces, so they never ride an agent lane
# unreviewed. Agents author via PR; the owner is always the reviewer of record.
/.github/workflows/     @Yolkster64

# --- Multi-LLM hub (C#/F# + Python spoke): Claude session + Copilot agent lane.
/src/ai/                @Yolkster64

# --- MCP server: Claude session lane (tool surface consumed by Claude Code).
/src/mcp/               @Yolkster64

# --- GUI shell (WinUI 3, Windows-only solution): Claude session dispatching
# ui-designer/theme-designer/ux-reviewer agents (FORWARD_PLAN T5).
/src/gui/               @Yolkster64

# --- Azure infrastructure (Bicep/Terraform): Claude session authors, owner
# applies (deploys are owner-gated OIDC via helios-deploy.yml).
/infra/                 @Yolkster64

# --- Agent instructions and skills: Claude session lane. Changes here steer
# every future agent session — treat edits like config for the whole program.
/.claude/               @Yolkster64

# --- Architecture docs (wiki source of truth): Claude session lane.
/docs/                  @Yolkster64

# --- Governance artifacts themselves: owner-only (rulesets gate the repo).
/.github/rulesets/      @Yolkster64
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @Yolkster64
/.github/dependabot.yml @Yolkster64
